    "Content": "<p><strong>In early January 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure&nbsp;SQL:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/hsfog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enable transparent cross-region failover of Azure SQL Hyperscale databases using auto-failover groups</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
